hadiths[75]{hadithnumber,text}:
"110","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne hadas kya uski namaz qabool nahi hoti yahan tak ke wo wuzu karey. Hadramaut key aik aadmi ne kaha: Ae Abu Hurairah! Hadas kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Kharij honay wali hawa (fusaa ya zuraat). (Bukhari: 135)"
"111","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak meri ummat Qiyaamat key din bulaai jaaeygi jabke wuzu key nishaanon se unki peshaaniyaan aur haath paon chamaktey hongey. To tum mein se jo apni chamak lambi karney ki taaqat rakkhey to use karna chaahiye. (Bukhari: 136)"
"112","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Yazeed Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us aadmi ki shikaayat ki jisey gumaan hota hai ke wo namaz mein kuchh paata hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo na phirey ya na wapas jaey yahan tak ke aawaaz suney ya boo paaey. (Bukhari: 137)"
"113","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) soey yahan tak ke kharraatey liye, phir namaz padhi aur wuzu na kya. Aur baaz auqaat farmaya: Letey yahan tak ke kharraatey liye, phir uthay aur namaz padhi. (Bukhari: 138)"
"114","[AI-translation] Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Arafaat se chaley yahan tak ke jab ghaati mein they to utrey aur peshaab kya, phir wuzu kya aur wuzu poora na kya. To main ne kaha: Namaz Ya Rasulullah! To Aap ne farmaya: Namaz tumharey saamney hai. To Aap sawaar huey, phir jab Muzdalifa tashreef laaey to utrey aur wuzu kya aur wuzu poora kya. Phir namaz key liye iqaamat kahi gai to Aap ne Maghrib ki namaz padhi, phir har insaan ne apna oont apne thikaaney mein bithaaya, phir Isha key liye iqaamat kahi gai to Aap ne (Isha) padhi aur un donon key darmiyaan (koi namaz) na padhi. (Bukhari: 139)"
"115","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne wuzu kya aur apna chehra dhoya. Unhon-ne paani ka aik chullu liya aur us se kulli ki aur naak mein paani daala. Phir paani ka aik chullu liya aur usey aisa kya, use apne doosrey haath key sath mila kar us se apna chehra dhoya. Phir paani ka aik chullu liya aur us se apna daayaan haath dhoya. Phir paani ka aik chullu liya aur us se apna baayaan haath dhoya. Phir apne sar ka masah kya. Phir paani ka aik chullu liya aur apne daaen paon par chhidka yahan tak ke use dhoya. Phir doosra chullu liya aur us se apna paon yaani baayaan dhoya. Phir kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aisa wuzu kartey huey dekha hai. (Bukhari: 140)"
"116","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab bait-ul-khala mein daakhil hotey to farmatey: Ae Allah! Beshak main naapaak jinon (naron) aur jinniyon (maadaon) se teri panaah maangta hun. (Bukhari: 142)"
"117","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bait-ul-khala mein daakhil huey. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne Aap key liye wuzu ka paani rakkha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye kis ne rakkha hai? To Aap ko khabar di gai. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Use deen mein samajh ataa farma. (Bukhari: 143)"
"118","[AI-translation] Abu Ayyub Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi qaza-e-haajat key liye aaey to na qibley ki taraf munh karey aur na usey peeth dey. Mashriq ya maghrib ki taraf (munh) karo. (Bukhari: 144)"
"119","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak log kehtey hain: Jab tum apni haajat key liye baitho to na qibley ki taraf munh karo aur na Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf. Beshak main aik din hamaarey aik ghar ki chhat par chadha to main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko do eenton par Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf munh kiye (haajat key liye baithey) dekha. (Bukhari: 145). Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke wo kehtey they: Beshak log kehtey hain ke jab tum apni haajat key liye baitho to na qibley ki taraf munh karo aur na Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha: Beshak main aik din hamaarey aik ghar ki chhat par chadha. To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apni haajat key liye do eenton par Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf munh kiye dekha. Aur kaha: Shayad tum un mein se ho jo apne koolhon par namaz padhtey hain? To main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main nahi jaanta. Maalik ne kaha: Yaani wo jo namaz padhta hai aur zameen se uncha nahi hota, sajda karta hai jabke wo zameen se chipka hota hai. (145). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"120","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwiyaan raat ko jab qaza-e-haajat key liye (baahar) jaatein to Manasi ki taraf nikaltein, aur wo khula maidaan hai. To Umar Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kehtey they: Apni biwiyon ko parda karaaiye. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisa na kartey they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi Sauda bint Zamaa raaton mein se aik raat Isha key waqt niklein, aur wo lambi aurat thein. To Umar ne unhey pukaara: Khabardaar! Beshak ham ne tumhey pehchaan liya hai ae Sauda! Is hirs mein ke parda (ki aayat) naazil ho jaey. To Allah ne parda ki aayat naazil farmai. (Bukhari: 146)"
"121","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apni haajat key liye nikaltey to main aur aik ladka aatey jabke hamaarey sath paani ki mashkiza hoti."
"122","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Paani aur nezey key sath, Aap paani se istinja kartey they. (Bukhari: 150, 152)"
"123","[AI-translation] Abu Qataada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi piye to bartan mein saans na ley. Aur jab bait-ul-khala mein aaey to na apne daaen haath se apni sharmgaah ko chhuey aur na apne daaen haath se saaf karey. (Bukhari: 153)"
"124","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey chala jabke Aap apni haajat key liye nikley they aur Aap tawajjoh na farmaatey they. To main Aap key qareeb hua. To Aap ne farmaya: Merey liye patthar talaash karo jin se main saaf karun ya us jaisa, aur merey paas haddi aur gobar na laana. To main Aap key paas apne kapdon key kinaarey mein patthar laaya. To main ne unhey Aap key pehlu mein rakkha aur Aap se munh mod liya. Phir jab Aap faarigh huey to unhey unkey peechey lagaa diya. (Bukhari: 155)"
"125","[AI-translation] Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qaza-e-haajat key liye aey to mujhey hukm diya ke main Aap key paas teen patthar laaun. To mujhey do patthar milay, aur teesra talaash kya to na mila. To main ne gobar liya aur Aap key paas usey ley aaya. To Aap ne do patthar ley liye aur gobar phenk diya, aur farmaya: Ye gandagi hai. (Bukhari: 156)"
"126","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi ne aik aik martaba (har uzw dho kar) wuzu kya. (Bukhari: 157)"
"127","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zaid Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do do martaba (har uzw dho kar) wuzu kya. (Bukhari: 158)"
"128","[AI-translation] Usmaan bin Affaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne bartan manga to apni hatheliyon par teen martaba paani daala aur unhey dhoya. Phir apna daayaan (haath) bartan mein daakhil kya aur kulli ki aur naak mein paani daala. Phir apna chehra teen martaba dhoya aur apney haath kohniyon tak teen teen martaba dhoey. Phir apne sar ka masah kya. Phir apney paon takhnon tak teen martaba dhoey. Phir kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo merey is wuzu jaisa wuzu karey phir do rakatein padhey jin mein apne dil mein baat na karey to uskey pichhley gunaah maaf kar diye jaaengey. (Bukhari: 159)"
"129","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai ke Usmaan (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Kya main tumhey aik hadees na sunaaun, agar aik aayat na hoti to main tumhey wo na sunaata. Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo aadmi wuzu karey aur apna wuzu achhi tarah karey aur namaz padhey magar usey maaf kar diya jaaeyga jo uskey aur namaz key darmiyaan hai yahan tak ke wo use padh ley. Urwa ne kaha: Wo aayat (Beshak jo log chhupaatey hain jo ham ne waazeh dalael mein se naazil kya) hai. (Bukhari: 160)"
"130","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jo wuzu karey to use naak jhaadna chaahiye, aur jo pattharon se saaf karey to use taaq (martaba) karna chaahiye. (Bukhari: 161)"
"131","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi wuzu karey to apni naak mein paani daaley phir naak jhaadey. Aur jo pattharon se saaf karey to taaq (martaba) karey. Aur jab tum mein se koi apni neend se jaagey to apna haath apne wuzu (key paani) mein daakhil karney se pehley dho ley. Beshak tum mein se koi nahi jaanta ke uska haath ne raat kahaan guzaari. (Bukhari: 162)"
"132","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, aur un se kaha gaya tha: Ae Abu Abdur Rahman! Main ne tumhey chaar kaam kartey huey dekha hai jo main ne tumharey sahaaba mein se kisi ko kartey huey nahi dekha. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo kya hain? Us ne kaha: Main ne tumhey dekha ke tum arkaan mein se Yamaani donon key siwa nahi chhoote. Aur main ne tumhey dekha ke tum Sibti jootey pehentey ho. Aur main ne tumhey dekha ke tum zardi se khizaab kartey ho. Aur main ne tumhey dekha ke jab tum Makkah mein hotey ho to log ehraam baandhtey hain jab chaand dekhtey hain aur tum ehraam nahi baandhtey yahan tak ke Yaum-ut-Tarwiya ho jaata hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Arkaan ka to ye haal hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Yamaani donon key siwa chhoote huey nahi dekha. Aur Sibti jooton ka to ye haal hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aisa joota pehentey huey dekha jis mein baal nahi hain aur Aap us mein wuzu kartey hain, to main pasand karta hun ke unhey pehnun. Aur zardi ka to ye haal hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us se khizaab kartey huey dekha to main pasand karta hun ke us se khizaab karun. Aur ehraam ka to ye haal hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ehraam baandhtey huey nahi dekha yahan tak ke Aap ki oontni Aap ko ley kar seedhi hoti. (Bukhari: 166)"
"133","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne jootey pehentey, kanghi kartey, paaki haasil kartey aur apne har kaam mein daaen taraf se (shuru karna) pasand tha. (Bukhari: 168)"
"134","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha jabke Asr ki namaz ka waqt ho gaya tha. To logon ne wuzu (ka paani) talaash kya aur na paaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas wuzu (ka paani) laaya gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us bartan mein apna haath rakkha aur logon ko hukm diya ke us se wuzu karein. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne paani ko Aap ki ungliyon key neechey se ubalta hua dekha yahan tak ke un sab ne aakhir tak us se wuzu kar liya. (Bukhari: 169)"
"135","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab apna sar mundwaaya to Abu Talha sab se pehley they jinhon-ne Aap key baalon mein se liya. (Bukhari: 171)"
"136","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab kutta tum mein se kisi key bartan mein piye to use saat martaba dhoey. (Bukhari: 172)"
"137","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Kuttey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein masjid mein peshaab kartey aur aatey jaatey they. To wo us mein se kuchh par paani na chhidaktey they."
"138","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda namaz mein rehta hai jab tak wo masjid mein namaz ka intezaar karta hua ho, jab tak wo hadas na karey. (Bukhari: 176)"
"139","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Khaalid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Usmaan bin Affaan (Raziallahu anhu) se poochha aur main ne kaha: Bataaiye agar (aadmi) jima karey aur mani na nikley (to kya hukm hai)? To Usmaan ne kaha: Wo wuzu karey jaisey namaz key liye wuzu karta hai aur apni sharmgaah dhoey. Usmaan ne kaha: Main ne ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai. To main ne uskey baarey mein Ali aur Zubair aur Talha aur Ubayy bin Kaab se poochha to unhon-ne mujhey usi ka hukm diya. (Bukhari: 179)"
"140","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansaar mein se aik aadmi ko bulwa bheja. To wo aaya jabke uskey sar se (paani) tapak raha tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shayad ham ne tumhey jaldi mein daal diya? To us ne kaha: Haan. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tumhey jaldi ho ya tumhey mani na nikley to tum par wuzu (laazim) hai. (Bukhari: 180)"
"141","[AI-translation] Mugheera bin Shoaba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar mein they aur Aap apni haajat key liye gaey. Aur Mugheera Aap par paani daalney lagey jabke Aap wuzu kar rahey they. To Aap ne apna chehra aur apney haath dhoey aur apne sar ka masah kya aur moozon par masah kya. (Bukhari: 182)"
"142","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo aik raat Maimoona key paas rahey jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain aur wo unki khaala hain. To main takiye ki chaudai mein leta aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key ghar waley uski lambaai mein letey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) soey yahan tak ke jab aadhi raat hui ya us se thodi pehley ya us se thodi baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jaagey. To baith kar apne haath se apne chehrey se neend malney lagey. Phir Surah Aal-e-Imran ki aakhri das aayatein padhein. Phir latki hui mashkiza ki taraf uthay aur us se wuzu kya aur apna wuzu achhi tarah kya. Phir namaz padhney key liye khadey huey. Unhon-ne kaha: To main utha aur main ne waisa kya jaisa Aap ne kya tha. Phir main gaya aur Aap key pehlu mein khada ho gaya. To Aap ne apna daayaan haath merey sar par rakkha aur mera daayaan kaan pakad kar use marodney lagey. To Aap ne do rakatein padhein phir do rakatein phir do rakatein phir do rakatein phir do rakatein phir do rakatein, phir witr padha. Phir letey rahey yahan tak ke Aap key paas moazzin aaya. To uthay aur do halki rakatein padhein, phir nikley aur Subah ki namaz padhi. (Bukhari: 183). Aur is hadees ka asl pehley guzar chuka hai, aur un donon mein jo aik mein hai wo doosrey mein nahi hai."
"143","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne un se kaha: Kya tum mujhey dikha saktey ho ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kaisey wuzu kartey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. To unhon-ne paani manga aur apne donon haathon par daala phir unhey teen martaba dhoya. Phir apna haath bartan mein daakhil kya aur teen martaba kulli ki aur naak mein paani daala. Phir apna chehra teen martaba dhoya. Phir apney haath kohniyon tak do do martaba dhoey. Phir apne donon haathon se apne sar ka masah kya. To unhey aagey laaey aur peechey ley gaey. Apne sar key agley hissey se shuru kya yahan tak ke unhey apni gudi tak ley gaey. Phir unhey us jagah wapas laaey jahaan se shuru kya tha. Phir apney paon dhoey. (Bukhari: 185)"
"144","[AI-translation] Abu Juhaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dopahar key waqt hamaarey paas nikley. To Aap key paas wuzu (ka paani) laaya gaya aur Aap ne wuzu kya. To log Aap key wuzu key bachey huey paani mein se ley kar us se apney (chehrey aur haath) malney lagey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zohar ki do rakatein aur Asr ki do rakatein padhein jabke Aap key saamney nezah tha. (Bukhari: 187)"
"145","[AI-translation] Saaeb bin Yazeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey meri khaala Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas ley gaein aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak mera bhatija beemaar hai. To Aap ne merey sar par haath phera aur merey liye barkat ki dua ki. Phir Aap ne wuzu kya to main ne Aap key wuzu (key paani) mein se piya. Phir main Aap ki peeth key peechey khada hua aur main ne Aap key donon kandhon key darmiyaan Mohar-e-Nabuwwat dekhi jo jangli kabootar key (ghonsley key) suraakh jaisi thi. (Bukhari: 190)"
"146","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Mard aur auratein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein sab (aik hi bartan se) wuzu kartey they. (Bukhari: 193)"
"147","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) meri ayaadat key liye tashreef laaey jabke main beemaar tha aur hosh mein na tha. To Aap ne wuzu kya aur mujh par apne wuzu (key paani) mein se daala to mujhey hosh aa gaya. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meeraas kiskey liye hai? Beshak mujh se kalaala wala waaris hoga? To Faraaez ki aayat naazil hui. (Bukhari: 194)"
"148","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Namaz ka waqt aa gaya to jo ghar key qareeb they apne ghar walon ki taraf uthay aur qaum baaqi rahi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas patthar ka lagan laaya gaya jis mein paani tha. Phir lagan chhota tha ke Aap us mein apni hatheli phailaaein. To saari qaum ne wuzu kar liya. Ham ne kaha: Tum kitney they? Unhon-ne kaha: Assi aur zyada. (Bukhari: 195)"
"149","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pyaala manga jis mein paani tha. To Aap ne us mein apney haath aur apna chehra dhoya aur us mein kulli ki. (Bukhari: 196)"
"150","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka bojh badh gaya aur Aap ka dard sakht ho gaya to Aap ne apni biwiyon se ijazat maangi ke Aap merey ghar mein teemaardaari mein rahein. To unhon-ne Aap ko ijazat dey di. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) do aadmiyon key darmiyaan nikley jabke Aap key donon paon zameen mein ghisat rahey they, Abbas aur aik doosrey aadmi key darmiyaan. To Aisha (Raziallahu anha) bayan karti thein ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne ghar mein daakhil honay key baad jabke Aap ka dard sakht ho gaya tha farmaya: Mujh par saat mashkizon se (paani) bahaao jinki doriyaan na kholi gai hon, shayed main logon ko wasiyat karun. Aur Aap ko Hafsa key lagan mein jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain bithaaya gaya. Phir ham Aap par wo (paani) daalney lagey yahan tak ke Aap hamein ishaara karney lagey ke beshak tum ne kar diya. Phir Aap logon ki taraf nikley. (Bukhari: 198)"
"151","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne paani ka bartan manga. To Aap key paas chauda pyaala laaya gaya jis mein thoda paani tha. To Aap ne us mein apni ungliyaan rakkhein. Anas ne kaha: To main paani ko Aap ki ungliyon key darmiyaan se ubalta hua dekhney laga. To main ne andaza lagaaya ke jis ne wuzu kya wo sattar se assi key darmiyaan they. (Bukhari: 200)"
"152","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) saa se paanch mud tak (paani) se ghusl kartey they aur mud se wuzu kartey they. (Bukhari: 201)"
"153","[AI-translation] Saad bin Abi Waqqaas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne moozon par masah kya. Aur Abdullah bin Umar ne Umar se uskey baarey mein poochha to unhon-ne kaha: Haan, jab Saad tumhey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se koi hadees sunaaey to uskey baarey mein uskey siwa kisi se na poochho. (Bukhari: 202)"
"154","[AI-translation] Amr bin Umayya Zamri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko moozon par masah kartey huey dekha. (Bukhari: 204)"
"155","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Amr Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne amaamey aur moozon par masah kartey huey dekha. (Bukhari: 205)"
"156","[AI-translation] Mugheera bin Shoaba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar mein tha. To main ne Aap key moozey utaarney key liye jhuka to Aap ne farmaya: Unhey chhor do, beshak main ne unhey paak (haalat) mein pehna tha. To Aap ne un donon par masah kya. (Bukhari: 206)"
"157","[AI-translation] Amr bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bakri key shaaney se kaat kaat kar khaatey huey dekha. To Aap ko namaz key liye bulaaya gaya to Aap ne chhuri phenk di aur namaz padhi aur wuzu na kya. (Bukhari: 208)"
"158","[AI-translation] Suwaid bin Noman (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Khaibar key saal Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath nikley yahan tak ke jab wo Sahba mein they, aur wo Khaibar key qareeb tareen hai. To Aap ne Asr padhi, phir safar ka khaana manga to sattu key siwa kuchh na laaya gaya. To Aap ne uskey baarey mein hukm diya aur use ghoondha gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khaaya aur ham ne khaaya. Phir Aap Maghrib key liye uthay aur kulli ki aur ham ne kulli ki. Phir Aap ne namaz padhi aur wuzu na kya. (Bukhari: 209)"
"159","[AI-translation] Maimoona (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unkey paas shaaney (ka gosht) khaaya, phir namaz padhi aur wuzu na kya. (Bukhari: 210)"
"160","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne doodh piya aur kulli ki aur farmaya: Beshak us mein chiknaai hai. (Bukhari: 211)"
"161","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein oonghey to use so jaana chaahiye yahan tak ke us se neend door ho jaey. Beshak tum mein se koi jab namaz padhta hai jabke wo oongh raha hota hai to nahi jaanta, shayed wo maghfirat maangey aur apne aap ko bura kahey. (Bukhari: 212)"
"162","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein oonghey to use so jaana chaahiye yahan tak ke wo jaan ley ke wo kya padh raha hai. (Bukhari: 213)"
"163","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har namaz key waqt wuzu kartey they, aur ham mein se aik ko wuzu kaafi hota jab tak wo hadas na karta. (Bukhari: 214)"
"164","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina ya Makkah ki deewaron mein se aik deewar key paas se guzrey to do insaanon ki aawaaz suni jo apni qabron mein azaab diye jaa rahey they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Unhey azaab diya jaa raha hai aur unhey badi (cheez) mein azaab nahi diya jaa raha. Phir farmaya: Kyun nahi! Un mein se aik peshaab se nahi bachta tha, aur doosra chughli khaata phirta tha. Phir Aap ne taaza shaakh mangaai aur use do tukdon mein toda aur un donon mein se har qabr par aik tukda rakkha. To Aap se kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne ye kyun kya? Aap ne farmaya: Shayad un se takhfeef ki jaey jab tak wo khushk na hon. (Bukhari: 216)"
"165","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apni haajat key liye farigh hotey to main Aap key paas paani laata aur Aap us se ghusl kartey they. (Bukhari: 217)"
"166","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik dehaati khada hua aur masjid mein peshaab kar diya. To logon ne usey pakad liya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Usey chhor do aur uskey peshaab par aik dol paani baha do. Beshak tum aasaani karney waley bana kar bhejey gaey ho aur tum sakhti karney waley bana kar nahi bhejey gaey. (Bukhari: 220)"
"167","[AI-translation] Umm Qais bint Mihsan (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas apna chhota beta laaein jis ne khaana khaana shuru na kya tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use apni god mein bithaaya. To us ne Aap key kapdey par peshaab kar diya. To Aap ne paani manga aur us par chhidka aur use dhoya nahi. (Bukhari: 223)"
"168","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qaum key koodey key dher par tashreef laaey aur khadey ho kar peshaab kya. Phir paani manga to main Aap key paas paani laaya aur Aap ne wuzu kya. (Bukhari: 224)"
"169","[AI-translation] Aur Huzaifa se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Wo deewar key peechey qaum key koodey key dher par aey. To khadey huey jaisey tum mein se koi khada hota hai aur peshaab kya. To main un se door hata to unhon-ne mujhey ishaara kya. To main Aap key paas aaya aur Aap ki aidi key paas khada raha yahan tak ke Aap faarigh huey. (Bukhari: 225)"
"170","[AI-translation] Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aurat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai aur us ne kaha: Bataaiye ham mein se aik ko haiz kapdey mein aaey to wo kya karey? Aap ne farmaya: Use khurachey phir paani se maley aur us par paani chhidkey aur us mein namaz padhey. (Bukhari: 227)"
"171","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Faatima bint Abi Hubaish Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaein aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main istihaaza wali aurat hun aur paak nahi hoti. To kya main namaz chhor dun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nahi, beshak wo rag hai aur haiz nahi hai. Phir jab tumhara haiz aaey to namaz chhor do, aur jab door ho jaey to apne aap se khoon dho daalo phir namaz padho. Aur farmaya: Phir har namaz key liye wuzu karo yahan tak ke wo waqt aa jaey. (Bukhari: 228)"
"172","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key kapdey se janaabat dhoya karti thi. To Aap namaz key liye nikaltey jabke Aap key kapdey mein paani key dhabbey hotey. (Bukhari: 229)"
"173","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ukl ya Uraina key kuchh log aey aur Madina ki aab-o-hawa unhey raas na aai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey doodh denay wali oontniyon (key paas jaaney) ka hukm diya aur ke wo unkey peshaab aur unkey doodh mein se piyein. To wo chaley gaey. Phir jab wo sehatyaab huey to unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key charwaahey ko qatl kar diya aur maweshiyon ko haank ley gaey. To din key awwal hissey mein khabar aai. To Aap ne unkey peechey (aadmi) bhejey. Phir jab din chadh aaya to wo laaey gaey. To Aap ne hukm diya aur unkey haath aur paon kaat diye gaey aur unki aankhein garam salakhon se phod di gain aur wo Harra mein phenk diye gaey, wo paani maangtey they aur unhey pilaaya na jaata tha. (Bukhari: 233)"
"174","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid banney se pehley bakriyon key baadon mein namaz padhtey they. (Bukhari: 234)"
"175","[AI-translation] Maimoona (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us choohey key baarey mein poochha gaya jo ghee mein gir gaya tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Use aur jo uskey gird hai phenk do aur use hata do, aur apna ghee khao. (Bukhari: 235)"
"176","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Har zakhm jo Musalman Allah key raastey mein khaata hai wo Qiyaamat key din aisa hoga jaisa us waqt tha jab zakhmi hua tha, khoon ubalta hua. Rang khoon ka rang aur khushbu musk ki khushbu hogi. (Bukhari: 237)"
"177","[AI-translation] Aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi thehrey huey paani mein jo behta na ho peshaab na karey phir us mein ghusl karey. (Bukhari: 239). Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Ham aakhri aur sabqat ley jaaney waley hain (238). Aur isi sanad key sath: Tum mein se koi thehrey huey paani mein jo behta na ho peshaab na karey phir us mein ghusl karey (239). To Zabidi ne pehla jumla chhor diya, bawajood ye ke wo bareek nazar ki tawajjoh ka maqaam hai. Beshak shaariheen ne kaha hai ke is hadees key awwal aur aakhir key darmiyaan koi munaasibat nahi hai. Aur unhon-ne kaha ke shayed Abu Hurairah Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas they jab Aap ne farmaya: Ham aakhri aur sabqat ley jaaney waley hain. To wo haajat key liye nikley phir daakhil huey aur Nabi ko paaya ke Aap hadees (peshaab na karey) shuru kar chukey they. To Abu Hurairah ne donon ko aik sanad key sath riwayat kya. Faqeer kehta hai: Alhamdulillah! Main ne hadees key awwal aur aakhir key darmiyaan munaasibat paa li hai. To uska maana hai ke ham aakhri aur sabqat ley jaaney waley hain aur Muhammadi aadaab key sath adab sikhaae huey hain. To is ummat jo behtareen ummat hai usey laaeq nahi ke un mein se koi thehrey huey paani mein peshaab karey phir us mein ghusl karey. Aur ye Ziyaai ijaadaat mein se hai. Aur merey is ijaad key durust honay ki daleel ye hai ke ye jumla Sahih Bukhari mein mukhtalif mutafarriq ahaadees key shuru mein waaqe hua hai jahaan aadaab ki riayat munaasib hai, jaise Jumuah key ghusl aur ameer ki itaat aur lagi (qasam) ki qasam chhorna aur nigaah neechi rakhna aur unkey siwa. To Zabidi ne use baaz mein zikr kya aur baaz mein chhor diya. Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"178","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Bait (Kaaba) key paas namaz padh rahey they jabke Abu Jahl aur uskey saathi baithey huey they. Jab un mein se baaz ne baaz se kaha: Tum mein se kaun fulaan ki oontni ki ojhdi laaeyga aur use Muhammad ki peeth par rakkheyga jab wo sajda karey? To qaum ka badtareen shakhs utha aur use ley aaya. To us ne dekha yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sajda kya aur use Aap ki peeth par Aap key donon kandhon key darmiyaan rakkha. Aur main dekh raha tha aur kuchh kaam na aa sakta tha, kaash merey paas (bachaaney wali) taaqat hoti. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo hansney lagey aur un mein se baaz baaz ki taraf (hans hans kar) jhukney lagey. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajdey mein they, apna sar nahi uthaatey they. Yahan tak ke Aap key paas Faatima aaein aur unhon-ne Aap ki peeth se use hata diya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna sar uthaaya, phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Quraish par (azaab kar). Teen martaba. To un par giraan guzra jab Aap ne un par baddua ki. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo samajhtey they ke us shehar mein dua qabool hoti hai. Phir Aap ne naam liye: Ae Allah! Abu Jahl par aur Utba bin Rabeea par aur Shaiba bin Rabeea par aur Waleed bin Utba par aur Umayya bin Khalaf par aur Uqba bin Abi Muait par. Aur saatwein ko gina to raawi bhool gaya. Unhon-ne kaha: To qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak main ne unhey dekha jinhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne gina tha, Badr key kuwein mein aundhey parhey huey. (Bukhari: 240)"
"179","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne kapdey mein thooka. (Bukhari: 241)"
"180","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad Saaedi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke logon ne un se poochha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zakhm ka ilaaj kis cheez se kya gaya tha? To unhon-ne kaha: Koi baaqi na raha jo mujh se zyada usey jaanney wala ho. Ali apni dhaal mein paani ley kar aatey they aur Faatima Aap key chehrey se khoon dhotin thein. To chaataai li gai aur jalaai gai aur us (ki raakh) se Aap ka zakhm bhar diya gaya. (Bukhari: 243)"
"181","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko apne haath mein miswaak se daant saaf kartey huey paaya jabke Aap (halq se) aw aw farma rahey they, aur miswaak Aap key munh mein thi, goya Aap qay kar rahey they. (Bukhari: 244)"
"182","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat ko uthtey to miswaak se apna munh saaf kartey they. (Bukhari: 245)"
"183","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne khud ko miswaak se miswaak kartey huey dekha. To merey paas do aadmi aey jin mein se aik doosrey se bada tha. To main ne chhotey ko miswaak di. To mujh se kaha gaya: Badey (ko do). To main ne use badey ko dey di."
"184","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum apne bistar par aao to namaz key wuzu jaisa wuzu karo, phir apni daaen karwat par leto, phir kaho: Ae Allah! Main ne apna chehra teri taraf kar diya aur apna maamla terey supurd kar diya aur apni peeth teri taraf lagaa di, teri taraf raghbat aur khauf key sath. Tujh se bachney ki koi jagah aur najaat ki koi raah nahi magar teri taraf. Ae Allah! Main teri Kitaab par imaan laaya jo tune naazil ki aur terey Nabi par jo tune bheja. Phir agar tum apni is raat mein mar gaey to fitrat par ho. Aur inhey aakhri banaao jo tum kehtey ho. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne use Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par dohraaya. Phir jab main (Ae Allah! Main teri Kitaab par imaan laaya jo tune naazil ki) tak pahuncha to main ne kaha: Aur terey Rasool par. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, (kaho) Aur terey Nabi par jo tune bheja. (Bukhari: 247). Kitaab-ul-Ghusl."
